# Content and voice

- Headline, location, roles, and featured lists are data in `src/content/` (plus locale keys). They will change; do not hardcode them in rules or TSX.
- English is the default locale. FR/HE are careful translations, not word-for-word dumps.
- Forbidden on the home: “passionate”, “fast learner”, “Sprint-N”, 40 tool logos, YouTube, MATLAB, PHP, bootcamp exercise names.
- Featured work and employer copy live in `src/content/` and locale JSON only. Home cards come from those lists. School or side projects stay off the home unless the user asks (see `_parked.md`).
- Employer or product UI: high-level copy (role, stack, environment). No screenshots unless the user says yes.
- Public contact: email, LinkedIn, GitHub, CV PDF. No phone in the UI.
- Senior tone: own, ship, operate, integrate. Not enthusiastic, passionate, or team-player filler.
